WEBVTT

00:00:29.758 --> 00:00:31.638
And then the next day, boom,

00:00:31.658 --> 00:00:33.998
we were in a head-on collision
with a pandemic

00:00:34.018 --> 00:00:36.278
that nobody knew what to do about.

00:00:36.678 --> 00:00:38.598
Authorities jumped to action.

00:00:38.918 --> 00:00:40.058
Don't go to church,

00:00:40.098 --> 00:00:41.238
don't go to the mosque,

00:00:41.258 --> 00:00:42.418
don't see your friends,

00:00:42.438 --> 00:00:44.598
don't go to restaurants, don't go outside,

00:00:44.618 --> 00:00:47.798
don't use public transport
and don't visit your parents,

00:00:47.818 --> 00:00:49.098
don't go to school,

00:00:49.118 --> 00:00:50.378
don't go to work.

00:00:50.398 --> 00:00:55.698
It was a barrage of "don'ts"
from every direction possible.

00:00:56.438 --> 00:00:57.678
It was a lot.